    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AKUMA's BLOODRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face <strong>hordes of</strong> <strong>akumas/yokais</strong> that are attacking and creating caos in a small japanese village. You're the only ninja alive that can protect this village from the eternal pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>slaughter all enemies</strong> without mercy before the time is up, the <strong>quicker and bloodier</strong> the better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akuma's Bloodrain</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced boomer shooter</strong> inspired by the classics DOOM and Shadow Warrior, where you have to use your <strong>weapons and ninja reflexes</strong> in the maximum level to beat the <strong>waves of akumas. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Shooting-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use you powerful shotgun to blow up your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies with wisdow! You won't be out of bullets but the enemy can catch you before you finish the reload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Gun.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Slashing-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your claws to tear your enemies in pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slashing enemies will not do much damage and if you may be in a dangerous position, but if you slash them when they are low health you will finish them much quicker, being able to score more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Slashing.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Moving-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash and climb in high speed to hunt your enemies  before they can even react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-pace game, if you are not dashing through the map to hunt your enemies you're doing it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Moving.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Message from developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We're brothers developing games, and Akuma is the retro shooter we designed to be bloody, challenging, and fun as hell!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hugo and Igor, developers of Akuma's Bloodrain</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AKUMA's BLOODRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face <strong>hordes of</strong> <strong>akumas/yokais</strong> that are attacking and creating caos in a small japanese village. You're the only ninja alive that can protect this village from the eternal pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>slaughter all enemies</strong> without mercy before the time is up, the <strong>quicker and bloodier</strong> the better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akuma's Bloodrain</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced boomer shooter</strong> inspired by the classics DOOM and Shadow Warrior, where you have to use your <strong>weapons and ninja reflexes</strong> in the maximum level to beat the <strong>waves of akumas. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Shooting-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use you powerful shotgun to blow up your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies with wisdow! You won't be out of bullets but the enemy can catch you before you finish the reload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Gun.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Slashing-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your claws to tear your enemies in pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slashing enemies will not do much damage and if you may be in a dangerous position, but if you slash them when they are low health you will finish them much quicker, being able to score more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Slashing.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Moving-Title.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash and climb in high speed to hunt your enemies  before they can even react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-pace game, if you are not dashing through the map to hunt your enemies you're doing it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/Gif-Moving.gif?t=1755642535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Message from developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We're brothers developing games, and Akuma is the retro shooter we designed to be bloody, challenging, and fun as hell!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hugo and Igor, developers of Akuma's Bloodrain</p>",
